You may be wondering why I chose the name *webindex.page*. Well the reason is quite simple.

I really wanted a domain name that includes my first name like *wendelin.dev*, but after checking the availability literally every single good TLD already taken!  
I pre-registered for *wendelin.web* but that TLD won't be operation for the foreseeable future because of [corporate greed](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/.web#Delays). 

The second reason is that short and single word TLDs usually cost more, for example *web.page* or *index.page* so I decided on *webindex.page* which actually doesn't sound too bad imo.